अहमेवाक्षय: कालो धाताहं विश्वतोमुख: ॥ ३३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3056,\"bb\":2702,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2702/\",\"body_value\":\"akṣarāṇām a-kāro ’smi
dvandvaḥ sāmāsikasya ca
aham evākṣayaḥ kālo
dhātāhaṁ viśvato-mukhaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3057,\"bb\":2703,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2703/\",\"shadow_value\":\"akṣarāṇām – of letters; a-kāraḥ – the first letter; asmi – I am; dvandvaḥ – the dual; sāmāsikasya – of compounds; ca – and; aham – I am; eva – certainly; akṣayaḥ – eternal; kālaḥ – time; dhātā – the creator; aham – I am; viśvataḥ-mukhaḥ – Brahmā.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"akṣarāṇām\",\"translation\":\"of letters\"},{\"word\":\"a-kāraḥ\",\"translation\":\"the first letter\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"dvandvaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the dual\"},{\"word\":\"sāmāsikasya\",\"translation\":\"of compounds\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"akṣayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"eternal\"},{\"word\":\"kālaḥ\",\"translation\":\"time\"},{\"word\":\"dhātā\",\"translation\":\"the creator\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"viśvataḥ-mukhaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Brahmā\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3058,\"bb\":2704,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2704/\",\"body_value\":\"Of letters I am the letter A, and among compound words I am the dual compound. I am also inexhaustible time, and of creators I am Brahmā.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3059,\"bb\":2705,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2705/\",\"body_value\":\"A-kāra, the first letter of the Sanskrit alphabet, is the beginning of the Vedic literature. Without a-kāra, nothing can be sounded; therefore it is the beginning of sound. In Sanskrit there are also many compound words, of which the dual word, like rāma-kṛṣṇa, is called dvandva. In this compound, the words rāma and kṛṣṇa have the same form, and therefore the compound is called dual.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3060,\"bb\":2706,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2706/\",\"body_value\":\"Among all kinds of killers, time is the ultimate because time kills everything. Time is the representative of Kṛṣṇa because in due course of time there will be a great fire and everything will be annihilated.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3061,\"bb\":2707,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/33/b2707/\",\"body_value\":\" Among the living entities who are creators, Brahmā, who has four heads, is the chief. Therefore he is a representative of the Supreme Lord, Kṛṣṇa.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 10.33\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 10.33\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"classNam